      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“世纪末霸王”好歌剧。她象征着太阳。\n照耀众人的希望之光。但是――希望不止是一道光吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a630b3167c6a93c9eba911d3edf1efb8944a88ccf63c52e999010159c1f20b8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
