    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8df3ed499007112b2dbbb5c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后，就此堕落――成为我的眷属吧。\n我在深渊等待着你。还有我身边这位豆豆柏洛斯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3718883aaad83cd106fe17a15f3f60c2bb75a7b44b77d091039eed15330aef18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
