      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "豆豆柏洛斯……！　您，您为我起了名字吗！？\n嘿嘿～！　那选择这件狗狗的衣服真是太好了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6641c5de7c40dacb8a260b11ff5f79f37e860ddf3b7dec8b6d3cea29c6d0d8",
